title: Lorina_House_Monologe
---
Lorina:Alice went missing again? I can not blame her for it.

Lorina:Meeting up with all of these suitors is exhausting. 

Lorina:I personally can’t stand to hear them go about their long-winded speech about why we should get courted.

Lorina:I can’t imagine her being able to sit through these introductory meetings without causing some kind of trouble.

Lorina:She’s always the type of kid to cause trouble. 

Lorina:I envy her for still being allowed to have that sense of childlike wonder.

Lorina:I guess I should go look for her before things get out of hand. 

Lorina:Maybe she’s in our usual spot by the tree.



===
